<p style="text-align: left;">These are a couple of small studies done over the weekend from our back yard and one done on location at Trappe Farm in Upperville, VA. Working on these small canvases is an exercise in painting the light and big shapes, not "things". &nbsp;I like them for their simplicity and as a way to set the mood for something larger.</p>